 gdocs-diff.el             | 35 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 test/gdocs-diff-test.el   | 42 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 test/gdocs-styles-test.el | 39 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 124 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

